n  who uses blood magic to contact her in  her dreams he offers to free hero who  was caught during the attempt in  exchange for the ring and in a gesture  of good faith he heals her wound Miriam  and the team devise a plan to rescue  hero Miriam will offer the ring while  Roland and Lachlan created a version one  which involves quittian unleashing at  Dragon chained Beneath The palace's  Depths here Miriam was once again face  off against her demonic brother killing  him knowing that her real brother has  long since died hero is able to escape  her confinement after the dragon's  Escape causes multiple explosions she  rushes to the safe house to acquire the  ring and Escape but is caught red-handed  we discover the reason Fairbanks  backstabbed her earlier on was that he  knew she was going to steal it but why  would Hira backstab her friends  especially her former lover it stems  back to her youth when her entire family  were killed by venatori basically an  armed Cult of internationalists thus she  has a deep hatred for tevinter and could  theoretically use this ring to bring her  family back or to destroy tevinter  itself for it is said should the  succulum go to the one that seeks it all  of tevinter will burn initially hero had  gone to the Inquisition and asked for  help in this matter but they didn't want  to get involved so she turned to reserin  to make a deal in exchange for the ring  Hira could give him the one thing he  wanted more than anything Miriam herself  for rezaren is so obsessed with making  right the events that went so wrong  those many years ago on the day of his  harrowing only Hira knew where to find  Miriam and had the power to bring her to  him thus the plan was hatched meanwhile  rezaren uses blood magic from nib's dead  body to take control of the Dragon the  team is helpless against the combined  power of the Magister and this Beast so  Miriam has no choice but to let go of  the Ring reserin then combines his nebs  and Miriam's blood 